---
import EbukafyLogo from '../assets/images/logos/EbukafyLogo.svg';
import ProjectHeader from './ProjectHeader.astro';
---
<div>
  <ProjectHeader title="ebukafy" subtitle="Convert text into ebooks" logo={EbukafyLogo} custommargin="3px" link="https://www.npmjs.com/package/ebukafy/" />
  <p>
    Ebukafy is an open-source collection of command-line tools used to convert html or text files into ebooks, with over 3,000 downloads on npm.
    It automates everything from chapter splitting and smart quote conversion to generating metadata and a table of contents.
  </p>
  <p>
    I often run across interesting articles or stories that I’d love to read away from the distraction of a browser screen.
    Ebukafy allows me to quickly convert that text into an ebook that I can read on my e-reader.
  </p>
</div>